Data Directory
Overview

This directory contains input data for the wafer yield prediction model.

Synthetic Data Format
111 wafer samples
12 critical electrical test parameters (before PCA reduction)
Output: Wafer yield values (0.0 - 1.0)
Data Structure
Sample | Param1 | Param2 | ... | Param12 | Yield
-------|--------|--------|-----|---------|-------
1      | value  | value  | ... | value   | 0.xxx
2      | value  | value  | ... | value   | 0.xxx
...
111    | value  | value  | ... | value   | 0.xxx
Real-World Data Integration

To use real wafer defect data:

Export data in CSV or XLSX format
Ensure 12 parameter columns + yield column
Place file in this directory
Update MATLAB script to load: dataMatrix = readtable('your_data.csv')
Defect Clustering Patterns

The project simulates 5 clustering patterns:

Bullseye: Circular pattern (center concentrated)
Bottom: Clustered at bottom edge
Crescent Moon: Semi-circular pattern
Edge: Clustered around edges
Random: Uniformly distributed
Data Notes
Current version uses synthetically generated wafer data
Simulations include Poisson-distributed defects
Variance-to-mean ratio (V/M) calculated for each pattern
CIM (Cluster Index Metric) = 1.24 for this dataset
